(TaskRunner pid=14766) \]
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) Write the expression  
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \[
(TaskRunner pid=14766) E = (75+117i)z+\frac{96+144i}{z}
