(TaskRunner pid=14766)      = (300+468i)e^{i\theta}+(24+36i)e^{-i\theta}.
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \]
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) Expand with \(e^{i\theta}=\cos\theta+i\sin\theta\) and \(e^{-i\theta}=\cos\theta-i\sin\theta\):
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \[
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \begin{aligned}
(TaskRunner pid=14766) (300+468i)e^{i\theta} &= (300\cos\theta-468\sin\theta) + i(300\sin\theta+468\cos\theta),\\[2pt]
(TaskRunner pid=14766) (24+36i)e^{-i\theta} &= (24\cos\theta+36\sin\theta) + i(36\cos\theta-24\sin\theta).
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \end{aligned}
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \]
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) Adding the real parts gives  
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \[
