(TaskRunner pid=14766) \]
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) Set  
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \[
(TaskRunner pid=14766) f(\theta)=324\cos\theta-432\sin\theta = A\cos\theta + B\sin\theta,
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \]
(TaskRunner pid=14766) where \(A=324,\; B=-432\).  
(TaskRunner pid=14766) The maximum value of \(A\cos\theta + B\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{A^{2}+B^{2}}\):
(TaskRunner pid=14766) 
(TaskRunner pid=14766) \[
